MAX FOSTER SAT DOWN WITH THE

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.755 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PEARL OF WESSEX TO TALK ABOUT

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:25.492 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE LEGACY, AND HOW THE

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.925 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MONARCHY IS TALKING WITH THE

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.495 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LATEST CHALLENGES.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:30.530 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEY LIVE HERE IN WINDSOR

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:31.831 size:53% position:73% line:0%
