I ASKED HIM ABOUT HIS FATHER'S

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.709 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LEGACY.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.576 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt;-YEAR-OLD HIGHNESS, THANK YOU

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.478 size:53% position:73% line:0%
VERY MUCH FOR SPEAKING TO US,

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.745 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS A VERY POIGNANT TIME OF

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.515 size:53% position:73% line:0%
COURSE.

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:49.916 size:53% position:73% line:0%
I KNOW YOU WANT TO FOCUS ON

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.283 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CELEBRATING YOUR FATHER'S LIFE

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:50.550 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AT THIS POINT.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:55.955 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INDEED.

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:57.791 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; NOT JUST A BROAD LIFE, BUT A

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.025 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LIFE THAT WAS INVOLVED IN SO

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:01.127 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MANY DIFFERENT INTERESTS, AND

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.394 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HE TRAVELED SO MUCH AND HE SAW

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.963 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SO MUCH.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:06.866 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NOT ONLY THAT BUT HE WAS THE

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.967 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SORT OF PERSON THAT ONCE MET,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.002 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NEVER FORGOTTEN.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.904 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT WOULD'VE BEEN YOUR

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:13.006 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FATHER'S 100TH BIRTHDAY, HOW DO

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.339 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YOU THINK HE LOOKS BACK ON HIS

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:15.775 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PUBLIC WORK?

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.843 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE WAS ALWAYS, ALWAYS

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:20.747 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INCREDIBLY --

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:22.916 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HE JUST GAVE THEM THE NUDGE OF

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:24.851 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ENCOURAGEMENT AND OFF HE WENT.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:28.555 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TRAGICALLY, IT WASN'T UNTIL HE

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:29.122 size:53% position:73% line:0%
