00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:30.957 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WOW, THAT IS WHAT HE DID.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:36.930 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OF COURSE IT IS TOO LATE.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:38.898 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT THEN, I SUSPECT THAT IF HE

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:40.033 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HAD MADE IT TO HIS 100TH

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:40.867 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BIRTHDAY, A LOT OF THAT

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.772 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WOULD'VE COME OUT.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:46.940 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT WOULD'VE BEEN LOVELY FOR HIM

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:49.776 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TO HAVE HEARD IT HIMSELF.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:51.778 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT THEN AGAIN, BECAUSE HE WAS

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:54.781 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JUST SO SELF FACING, HE JUST

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:58.885 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WOULDN'T WANT THE FUSS AND I

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:59.119 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DON'T THINK HE WANTED TO REACH

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:00.920 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.221 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HE JUST THOUGHT IT WOULD BE TOO

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.255 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MUCH FUSS.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:07.060 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT WAS JUST NOT HIM AT ALL.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:08.995 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; MANY PEOPLE MAY THINK OF IT

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:10.864 size:53% position:73% line:0%
