00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:11.931 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT IT IS MORE THAN THAT, IT IS

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.999 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ALMOST A MOTIVATIONAL SELF

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:15.068 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CONFIDENT EXERCISE.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.902 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT IS A FRAMEWORK.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:16.236 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT IS A FRAMEWORK OF

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:18.271 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ACTIVITIES.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:20.840 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS TO ENCOURAGE YOUNG PEOPLE,

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:22.108 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND ADULTS TO GET INVOLVED IN

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:25.845 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THESE ACTIVITIES.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:27.847 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND OF COURSE, IT IS EMPOWERED

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.815 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BOTH ADULTS AND YOUNG PEOPLE TO

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.115 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TAKE CONTROL OF THEIR

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.917 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DESTINIES.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:33.853 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT DOESN'T MATTER WHERE IN THE

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:35.855 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WORLD, IN FACT THAT YOUNG

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.089 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PERSON OR ADULT IS, IT IS THE

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.957 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SAME.

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:40.093 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT IS THE REASON WHY I THINK

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:43.029 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT SPREAD TO 130 COUNTRIES.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.864 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS DOING PARTICULARLY WELL

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:46.833 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IN THE STATES, IT WAS A BIT OF

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.133 size:53% position:73% line:0%
A LATE START, BUT IT IS

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.968 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BRILLIANT.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.969 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND WHAT IS VERY EXCITING ABOUT

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.871 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT'S HAPPENING IN THE STATE,

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:53.840 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NEARLY 50% OF THE YOUNG PEOPLE

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:55.141 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INVOLVED OR FROM WHAT WE WOULD

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:58.077 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CALL AT RISK OR MARGINALIZED

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:59.045 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YOUNG PEOPLE, AND DISADVANTAGED

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:01.147 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YOUNG PEOPLE, AND THAT IS

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:01.714 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BRILLIANT BECAUSE THOSE ARE THE

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:02.182 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PEOPLE THAT CAN VERY MUCH

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:03.149 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BENEFIT FROM THIS.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:05.018 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO TALK ABOUT HIS

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:07.353 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OTHER ROLES, A BIGGER ROLE,

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:09.889 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ARGUABLY, HIS ROLE AS --

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.990 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PROBABLY THE BIGGEST INFLUENCE

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.358 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ON ARGUABLY ONE OF THE BIGGEST

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.759 size:53% position:73% line:0%
RAINS OF BRITISH HISTORY, AWAY

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:17.397 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FROM THE QUEEN.

