00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:24.204 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR ASKING.

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:24.771 size:53% position:73% line:0%
I THINK ACTUALLY, WE'RE DOING

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.739 size:53% position:73% line:0%
