00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:31.778 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT WAS A FANTASTIC PARTNERSHIP.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:32.045 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LIFE HAS GOTTEN CONSIDERABLY

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:37.784 size:53% position:73% line:0%
