00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:52.065 size:53% position:73% line:0%
POIGNANT AND A BIT HARDER.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:54.100 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AT THE MOMENT, THANK YOU VERY

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:55.802 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MUCH INDEED FOR ASKING, BUT I

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:56.035 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THINK EVERYONE IS IN GOOD

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:57.203 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SHAPE.

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:58.071 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; I DON'T UPRIGHT TOO MUCH,

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.906 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT THIS IS A PRIVATE MATTER

00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:05.812 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT IT'S ALSO VERY PUBLIC, BUT

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:07.046 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT MUST OF BEEN A FAMILY RIFT,

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:07.847 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT MUST HAVE BEEN VERY

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:10.016 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DIFFICULT FOR HER.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:10.316 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HOW IS SHE COPING WITH THAT,

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:13.920 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CAN I ASK?

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:14.520 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT ALL DEPENDS --

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.455 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ARE YOU EUPHEMISTICALLY WERE

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:15.722 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FRYING TO HARRY AND MEGHAN?

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:17.423 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:22.829 size:53% position:73% line:0%
[LAUGHS]

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:24.731 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YES, THE DIVIDE BETWEEN THE

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:25.231 size:53% position:73% line:0%
