00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:26.933 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FAMILY CURRENTLY.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:27.333 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:32.572 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS VERY SAD.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:34.440 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE HAVE ALL BEEN THERE BEFORE.

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:36.409 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE'VE ALL HAD EXCESSIVE

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:36.643 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INTRUSIONS AND ATTENTION IN OUR

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:39.445 size:53% position:73% line:0%
