00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.580 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE'VE ALL DEALT WITH IT IN

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:42.682 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DIFFERENT WAYS.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.583 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LISTEN, WE WISH THEM THE VERY

00:04:42.849 --> 00:04:45.685 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BEST OF LUCK.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:47.654 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS A VERY HARD DECISION.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:49.989 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FANTASTIC NEWS ABOUT THE BABY.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:58.164 size:53% position:73% line:0%
I HOPE THEY WILL BE VERY HAPPY.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.498 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FAMILY AS A FAMILY.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:05:00.433 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:02.268 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THEY DO HAPPEN IN ALL FAMILIES,

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.369 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT'S JUST THE VERY PUBLIC

00:05:02.435 --> 00:05:05.238 size:53% position:73% line:0%
