00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:07.440 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT IS DIFFICULT FOR

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.574 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EVERYONE.

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:12.178 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT IS DIFFICULT FOR EVERYONE.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:12.478 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT AS I SAID, THAT IS

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:14.414 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FAMILIES.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.348 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE TALKED ABOUT HOW SHE JUST

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.216 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CARRIES ON IN A VERY REMARKABLE

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:19.218 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WAY, A VERY INSPIRING WAY, THE

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.320 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES,

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:23.256 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CURRENTLY IN THE UNITED KINGDOM,

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:29.962 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE QUEEN HAS MET SO MANY

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:30.563 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PRESIDENTS, I WONDER WHAT IT

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:31.464 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MUST BE AN OPPORTUNITY FOR

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:34.167 size:53% position:73% line:0%
