00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.635 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DONE THAT, HAD THAT EXPERIENCE

00:05:35.535 --> 00:05:36.469 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AS WELL?

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:40.173 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU MEET SOMEBODY WHO

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:43.976 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HAS HAD THAT LEVEL OF PERSONAL

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:52.318 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EXPERIENCE AND KNOWLEDGE, --

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:54.454 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SOME PEOPLE, AND I THINK MOST

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:54.721 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PEOPLE WISH THEY HAD A BIT

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.522 size:53% position:73% line:0%
