THAT'S USUALLY THE RESPONSE.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.626 size:53% position:73% line:0%
GOD, I WANTED TO HAVE A LITTLE

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:00.960 size:53% position:73% line:0%
