00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:02.495 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FASCINATING.

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:03.563 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEY ALWAYS STAY PRIVATE

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:05.531 size:53% position:73% line:0%
