00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:15.108 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT IS VERY IMPORTANT.

00:06:12.138 --> 00:06:15.775 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE FACT THAT THEY ALL SAY IT

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:16.376 size:53% position:73% line:0%
