00:06:15.942 --> 00:06:21.781 size:53% position:73% line:0%
VERY STRANGE IN THIS WORLD.

00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:22.415 size:53% position:73% line:0%
U.S. PEER TO APPEAR

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:23.116 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INSTANTANEOUSLY, THE FACT THAT

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:25.952 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NOTHING LIKE THAT HAPPENS

