DOESN'T MEAN THAT PEOPLE REALLY

00:06:26.119 --> 00:06:29.756 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DO RESPECT THE FACT THAT THIS

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:31.090 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IS A GENUINELY PRIVATE, OFF THE

